description "Lobot

A man of few words, he prefers to commune with the technological over the biological.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Lobot's Wrench (Yellow/Red Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- 125% more knockback
-- 100% more special damage
-- 35% shorter
-- 166% thicker
- Relby-K23 'Stinger' Pistol (WESTAR 2)
-- 15% more velocity
-- 25% faster RoF
-- 20% more damage/FP damage
- BSoD Frag Grenades (2)
-- Blinds on det
- Electro-Conc Grenades (3)
-- Shocks on det

^6Inventory:
- Medpac
- Forcefield
- Assault Sentry ^5{RC}

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor
- Armor Regen (1)
- Healing (2)
- Force Block (1)
- Passive Radar Scanner (Miraluka 1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Ally Stat Viewer
- Remote Viewer
- Lobotomized
- 30% faster hacking

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Shockwave ^3[CS3]
- Remote Control ^3[No Melee CS4]"